5
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,160
The design supplies context.

6
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:19,500
The agreed brief determines
what is included.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,680
This synthetic brief explicitly excludes

8
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:25,780
