the existing invoice.

29
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,400
The dedicated sandbox buyer
completes the purchase in PayPal.

30
00:01:41,420 --> 00:01:43,400
Authentication is omitted
from this recording.

31
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:47,040
This is a real sandbox
transaction using test funds.

32
00:01:47,780 --> 00:01:50,360
Payment is reconciled
against PayPal's own invoice.

33
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:56,720
PayPal invoice retrieval confirms
Paid on the same revision.

34
00:01:57,380 --> 00:01:59,640
Its signed callback was
separately verified.

35
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:08,200
Back in the released Figma plugin, check
payment confirms Paid and zero due.

36
00:02:08,980 --> 00:02:12,780
The approval and payment remain
attached to revision 1 of this change.

37
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:18,980
Close and reopen the plugin and
the same Paid revision returns.

38
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:22,720
Work begins after payment
is a commercial term.

39
00:02:23,380 --> 00:02:24,960
